---
mm: 1.2
kind: board
name: storage-linux-aarch64
derives-from: generic-linux-aarch64
platform-provider: platform.linux.map platform.linux.defaults
platform-provider: mm.mcu platform.linux.storage.device
platform-provider: mm.sdcard.socket platform.linux.storage.socket
---

# storage-linux-aarch64

The generic hosted AArch64 board with its MCU pointed at the emulated storage
bus, the same two rebindings as storage-linux-x86_64 on the other
architecture.
